 "PLOT" to replot/rescale the picture
 "SWAP" to PLOT the "alternate" solution (defined by "GO51")
 "MEAS" to measure points with the graphics CURSOR(stroke "M")
 "CHAN" to change a partial-wave and replot
 "OBS " to plot another observable on the same plot
